WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:25.197
A brand-new workspace is empty. Before importing email, tell the app which addresses are yours and which domains belong to your company.

2
00:00:25.197 --> 00:00:32.959
Your addresses let the app tell sent mail from received mail. The domains put colleagues into the Corporate circle.

3
00:00:32.959 --> 00:00:42.116
Open Import. Pick a source, add the export file, review what was found, and import. Each tile explains where to download the file.

4
00:00:42.116 --> 00:00:48.694
LinkedIn: Settings, Data privacy, Get a copy of your data, then choose Connections. You will get Connections.csv by email.

5
00:00:48.694 --> 00:00:56.107
Drop the file on the drop zone. The source is detected automatically from the file name and contents.

6
00:00:56.107 --> 00:01:02.854
Review shows how many people were found, a sample of names and companies, and any warnings.

7
00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:13.180
Done. The results table tells you how many people are new, how many merged into existing people, and how many relationships were created.

8
00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:19.203
Facebook: Settings, Your information, Download your information. Choose Friends and followers in JSON format.

9
00:01:19.203 --> 00:01:29.213
People who were already imported from LinkedIn are matched by name, so you get one person with two sources, not two people.

10
00:01:29.213 --> 00:01:43.720
X: request your archive, then drop follower.js and following.js. The archive only has account IDs, so add an X API key in Settings to resolve names, or use a CSV export.

11
00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:51.470
Contacts: export a vCard or CSV from Google Contacts, iPhone or Outlook.

12
00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:56.648
Email is the richest source. Export an mbox from Google Takeout, Apple Mail or Thunderbird.

13
00:01:56.648 --> 00:02:04.504
Only people you have exchanged mail with in both directions are imported, so newsletters and one-way notifications stay out.

14
00:02:04.504 --> 00:02:12.815
Email also records interactions, which drive the strength score and the activity timeline.

15
00:02:12.815 --> 00:02:17.647
All five sources, one network. Re-importing a file later is safe: nothing gets duplicated.
